#: ../../commands.md:1
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../commands.md:3
msgid ""
"Type `/` commands at the prompt to inspect state, switch models, manage "
"the session, or configure runtime behavior on the fly. Run `/help` for "
"the built-in reference."
msgstr ""
"在 prompt 中输入 `/` 命令，可以查看状态、切换模型、管理 session 或即时修改 runtime 行为。运行 `/help` "
"查看内置参考。"

#: ../../commands.md:7
msgid "Looking around"
msgstr "查看状态"

#: ../../commands.md:9
msgid ""
"**`/status`** — Shows everything about the runtime at a glance: workspace"
" path, session id, active provider and model, calculated compaction-"
"budget fill percentage, conversation history, prompt-cache hit ratio, "
"code index state, background jobs, and whether an update is available."
msgstr ""
"**`/status`** — 一览 runtime 全貌：工作目录、session id、当前 provider 和模型、计算出的 "
"compaction 预算占用百分比、对话历史、prompt-cache 命中率、代码索引状态、后台任务以及是否有可用更新。"

#: ../../commands.md:14
msgid ""
"The /status command showing workspace, session, provider, context, and "
"code index state"
msgstr "`/status` 显示工作目录、session、provider、context 和代码索引状态"

#: ../../commands.md:19
msgid "The /status output at a glance."
msgstr "`/status` 输出概览。"

#: ../../commands.md:22
msgid ""
"**`/diff`** — Review changes from the latest turn or the whole session. "
"See [Reviewing changes](usage.md#reviewing-changes)."
msgstr "**`/diff`** — 审查最近一轮或整个 session 的修改。见[审查修改](usage.md#reviewing-changes)。"

#: ../../commands.md:27
msgid ""
"The two tabs pick the range; each row is one changed file with its added "
"and removed line counts. `Enter` opens the selected file's diff."
msgstr "两个 tab 用于选择范围；每行代表一个已修改文件，并显示新增和删除行数。按 `Enter` 打开所选文件的 diff。"

#: ../../commands.md:30
msgid ""
"**`/ps`** — Lists active background jobs (see [Tools](tools.md#built-in-"
"tools)). Each row shows job id, state, command, and elapsed time."
msgstr ""
"**`/ps`** — 列出活动的后台任务（见[工具](tools.md#built-in-tools)）。每行显示任务 "
"id、状态、命令和运行时间。"

#: ../../commands.md:33
msgid ""
"**`/skills`** — Lists every installed [skill](skills.md) by name, source,"
" and description."
msgstr "**`/skills`** — 按名称、来源和描述列出所有已安装 [skill](skills.md)。"

#: ../../commands.md:36
msgid ""
"**`/config`** — Shows the active configuration: provider blocks, runtime "
"settings, and their resolved values."
msgstr "**`/config`** — 显示当前配置：provider block、runtime 设置及其解析后的值。"

#: ../../commands.md:39
msgid "The code index"
msgstr "代码索引"

#: ../../commands.md:41
msgid ""
"**`/index [force]`** — Build or rebuild the code symbol index that powers"
" `InspectCode`. The first build walks every source file; later syncs are "
"fast. Add `force` to rebuild from scratch. See [Code symbol "
"index](tools.md#code-symbol-index) for details."
msgstr ""
"**`/index [force]`** — 构建或重建 `InspectCode` "
"使用的代码符号索引。首次构建扫描所有源文件，后续同步很快。加上 `force` 可从头重建。详见[代码符号索引](tools.md#code-"
"symbol-index)。"

#: ../../commands.md:46
msgid "Switching models"
msgstr "切换模型"

#: ../../commands.md:48
msgid ""
"**`/provider [NAME]`** — Show or switch the active provider. Without an "
"argument it lists every configured provider (see "
"[Configuration](configuration.md#providers)) and lets you pick one "
"interactively. With a name it switches immediately."
msgstr ""
"**`/provider [NAME]`** — 显示或切换当前 provider。不带参数时列出全部已配置 provider（参见 "
"[配置](configuration.md#providers)），并打开交互式选择器；提供名称时立即切换。"

#: ../../commands.md:52
msgid ""
"**`/model [MODEL]`** — Show or switch the model for the current provider."
" Without an argument it opens an interactive picker with configured and "
"discovered models. Changing the model also prompts you to pick a "
"reasoning effort."
msgstr ""
"**`/model [MODEL]`** — 显示或切换当前 provider "
"的模型。不带参数时打开选择器，显示已配置和发现的模型。切换模型时还会要求选择 reasoning effort。"

#: ../../commands.md:56
msgid ""
"**`/reason [EFFORT]`** — Show or set reasoning effort. Values: `off`, "
"`minimal`, `low`, `medium`, `high`, `xhigh`, `max`. Minacode maps known "
"model families to their nearest supported level; unrecognized providers "
"and models keep the selected value. Without an argument it opens a "
"picker."
msgstr ""
"**`/reason [EFFORT]`** — 显示或设置 reasoning "
"effort。可选值：`off`、`minimal`、`low`、`medium`、`high`、`xhigh`、`max`。Minacode "
"会将已知 model family 映射到其最接近的受支持级别；未识别的 provider 和模型会保留所选值。不带参数时打开选择器。"

#: ../../commands.md:61
msgid "Switching providers and models interactively during a session"
msgstr "在 session 中交互式切换 provider 和模型"

#: ../../commands.md:66
msgid "Switching providers and models mid-session."
msgstr "在 session 中切换 provider 和模型。"

#: ../../commands.md:69
msgid "Managing the session"
msgstr "管理 session"

#: ../../commands.md:71
msgid ""
"**`/name [TEXT]`** — Show or set this session's name. See "
"[Names](usage.md#names)."
msgstr "**`/name [TEXT]`** — 查看或设置当前 session 的名称。参见[名称](usage.md#names)。"

#: ../../commands.md:73
msgid ""
"**`/sessions [all]`** — Browse saved sessions and re-enter one; `/resume`"
" is the same command. See [Switching sessions](usage.md#switching-"
"sessions)."
msgstr ""
"**`/sessions [all]`** — 浏览已保存的 session 并进入其中一个；`/resume` 是同一条命令。参见[切换 "
"session](usage.md#switching-sessions)。"

#: ../../commands.md:76
msgid ""
"**`/compact`** — Summarize and shrink the conversation immediately. "
"minacode keeps long sessions within budget on its own, but `/compact` "
"trims on demand."
msgstr "**`/compact`** — 立即总结并缩短对话。minacode 会自动控制长 session 的预算；`/compact` 用于按需压缩。"

#: ../../commands.md:79
msgid ""
"**`/yolo`** — Toggle confirmation prompts. See [Safety](safety.md) before"
" turning this off permanently."
msgstr "**`/yolo`** — 切换操作确认。永久关闭前请阅读[安全](safety.md)。"

#: ../../commands.md:82
msgid ""
"**`/hints`** — Toggle the model's suggested next-step chips at the idle "
"prompt (the `NextHints` tool). See [Tools](tools.md)."
msgstr ""
"**`/hints`** — 切换 idle 提示符处由模型建议的下一步 chip（`NextHints` "
"工具）。参见[工具](tools.md)。"

#: ../../commands.md:85
msgid "**`/strict`** — Toggle strict tool-call schemas (OpenAI / DeepSeek)."
msgstr "**`/strict`** — 切换严格 tool-call schema（OpenAI / DeepSeek）。"

#: ../../commands.md:87
msgid ""
"**`/worker [status|reset|on|off|provider|model|reason|api]`** — Inspect "
"or control the worker session: `status` (default) reports readable lines "
"— provider/model, reasoning, state, rounds, context percent — or `worker:"
" no active session` plus the configured `[worker] provider` when no "
"worker exists; `on`/`off` toggle the `runtime.worker` setting, and "
"`reset` clears the worker's context (file changes and merged diffs "
"survive). `provider` opens a picker over the provider entries — with "
"`off` at the end to clear — and choosing one flows on into the worker "
"model and then the reasoning pickers, mirroring `/provider`'s chain "
"(backing out of any stage keeps the earlier stages already set); "
"`provider NAME` re-targets the worker immediately and for future spawns "
"without the cascade, while `provider off` clears the entry. `model`, "
"`reason`, and `api` pick from the worker's entry models, reasoning "
"efforts, and wire protocols (`auto`, `chat`, `responses`, `anthropic`), "
"with `default` clearing an override back to inheriting the provider "
"entry's value; tab completion offers the subcommands and their values. "
"The `Delegate` tool block itself is fixed when the session starts from "
"the configured `[worker] provider`: switching the provider mid-session "
"tunes an already-enabled delegation, but enabling delegation from scratch"
" takes effect after a restart. See [Worker delegation](configuration.md"
"#worker-delegation)."
msgstr "**`/worker [status|reset|on|off|provider|model|reason|api]`** — 检查或控制 worker"
" 会话:`status`(默认)以可读的行报告——provider/model、推理、状态、轮数、上下文百分比——没有 worker 时显示 `work"
"er: no active session` 及配置的 `[worker] provider`;`on`/`off` 切换 `runtime.worke"
"r` 设置,`reset` 清除 worker 的上下文(文件改动与已合并的 diff 保留)。`provider` 打开 provider 条目的选择"
"器——末尾带 `off` 用于清除——选中一个后会接着进入 worker model、再进入推理选择器,与 `/provider` 的链路一致(在任一步"
"退出会保留前面已设置的阶段);`provider NAME` 不经级联,立即重新指定 worker,对未来生成的 worker 同样生效;`provid"
"er off` 清除该条目。`model`、`reason`、`api` 从 worker 条目的模型、推理强度与 wire 协议(`auto`、`ch"
"at`、`responses`、`anthropic`)中选择,`default` 清除覆盖、回到继承 provider 条目的值;Tab 补全会给出子"
"命令及其取值。`Delegate` 工具块本身在会话启动时根据配置的 `[worker] provider` 固定:会话中途切换 provider 只能"
"调优已启用的委派,从头启用委派需要重启后生效。参见 [Worker 委派](configuration.md#worker-delegation)。"

#: ../../commands.md:104
msgid ""
"A `Delegate send` is confirmed even under `yolo` — the prompt shows the "
"order, the one cheap check on a spec the model wrote for itself. The "
"confirmation prints an approval brief: the title, an excerpt of the first"
" order lines, any explicit `language` or `max_steps`, and the effective "
"worker provider/model/effort/api. `c` opens a small loop that adjusts "
"those worker settings before you decide; every send asks, and a refused "
"send feeds your reason back to the model."
msgstr "即使在 `yolo` 下,`Delegate send` 也会被确认——提示框展示 order,这是对模型自己写的 spec 唯一廉价的检查。确认时会打"
"印一份审批摘要:标题、order 前几行的摘录、显式的 `language` 或 `max_steps`,以及生效的 worker provider/m"
"odel/effort/api。`c` 会打开一个小循环,让你在决定前调整这些 worker 设置;每次 send 都会询问,被拒绝的 send 会把你"
"的理由反馈给模型。"

#: ../../commands.md:111
msgid ""
"**`/language [NAME]`** — Show or force the session's reply language. "
"Without an argument it prints the current value (`auto` by default). With"
" a name like `Chinese` it appends one fixed `LANGUAGE OVERRIDE` block to "
"the tail of the system prompt, so the cacheable prompt prefix stays "
"unchanged; `auto` follows your messages and injects nothing. The setting "
"is per-session — it is not written back to the configuration file — and "
"workers inherit it from the parent on every `Delegate` send."
msgstr "**`/language [NAME]`** — 显示或强制本会话的回复语言。不带参数时打印当前值(默认为 `auto`)。给定语言名(如 `Chine"
"se`)时,会在系统提示词尾部追加一个固定的 `LANGUAGE OVERRIDE` 块,因此可缓存的提示词前缀保持不变;`auto` 跟随你的消息、不"
"注入任何内容。该设置是 session 级的——不会写回配置文件——worker 会在每次 `Delegate` send 时从父级继承该设置。"

#: ../../commands.md:118
msgid ""
"**`/api [API]`** — Select or set the request protocol (`auto`, `chat`, "
"`responses`, `anthropic`) used to reach the model. `/provider` and "
"`/model` also confirm it as a step in their selection chain, since the "
"right protocol depends on the model you just picked."
msgstr ""
"**`/api [API]`** — "
"选择或设置访问模型所用的请求协议（`auto`、`chat`、`responses`、`anthropic`）。`/provider` 和 "
"`/model` 也会在各自的选择流程中确认该项，因为合适的协议取决于刚选定的模型。"

#: ../../commands.md:122
msgid ""
"An endpoint that serves several model families often exposes them on "
"different protocols, and an OpenAI-compatible `/models` listing says "
"nothing about which protocol serves which model — so a model offered by "
"`/model` can still be rejected as unsupported. When that happens, pick a "
"different protocol with `/api` (or `auto` to re-infer from the URL and "
"model). The reply names the wire that took effect, and history is "
"protocol-neutral, so switching mid-session is safe."
msgstr ""
"同一个端点常常以不同协议提供多个模型系列，而兼容 OpenAI 的 `/models` 列表并不会说明哪个模型由哪种协议提供——因此 "
"`/model` 列出的模型仍可能被拒绝为不受支持。出现这种情况时，用 `/api` 换一种协议（或用 `auto` 依据 URL "
"和模型重新推断）。回复会指明实际生效的协议，并且历史记录与协议无关，所以中途切换是安全的。"

#: ../../commands.md:128
msgid ""
"**`/set KEY VALUE`** — Set `provider.*` or `runtime.*` for the session; "
"tab-completes both keys and, where the values are a fixed set, the "
"values. Example: `/set provider.response_timeout 900`."
msgstr ""
"**`/set KEY VALUE`** — 为当前 session 设置 `provider.*` 或 `runtime.*`；key "
"以及有固定选项的 value 均支持 Tab 补全。例如：`/set provider.response_timeout 900`。"

#: ../../commands.md:131
msgid ""
"**`/resend`** — Cancel and re-send the in-flight model request without "
"restarting the turn. Type it while a model request is waiting; it has no "
"effect while the agent is running a tool or otherwise between model "
"calls. The divider briefly reports the retry, keeps its elapsed timer and"
" waiting pulse, then returns to `working` for the replacement request. "
"Automatic retries also show their attempt and concise reason, such as "
"`retrying 2/6 · timeout`, followed by `working · attempt 2/6` while that "
"request continues:"
msgstr ""
"**`/resend`** — 取消并重新发送正在进行的模型请求，而不重新开始当前轮次。仅在模型请求等待响应时输入；agent "
"正在运行工具或处于两次模型调用之间时，该命令不会生效。分隔线会短暂显示重试状态，同时保留已用时间和等待脉冲，随后在替代请求继续期间恢复为 "
"`working`。自动重试还会显示当前尝试次数和简短原因，例如 `retrying 2/6 · timeout`；随后在该请求继续时显示 "
"`working · attempt 2/6`："

